Closing the loop on this: A reminder that network passwords expire on a 60-=
day cycle. You will be prompted at next sign-in. Passwords may not be reuse=
d across the last twelve cycles and may not be stored in a browser. Contact=
 the service desk if you are locked out; the desk cannot reset a password w=
ithout callback verification. Let me know if anything looks off.